  {
    "id": 1803001010010,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "MEMちょです！\r\nよろしくお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "803",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010020,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "今も動画配信者として活動しています\r\nこう見えてバズらせのプロです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、頼もしいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺はここでプロデューサーをやっていて……\r\n今日からは君のことも担当する",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "困ったことやわからないこと、不安なこと、それ以外でも\r\n何かあったら遠慮なく教えてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010030,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010040,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010050,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "あっ、イエ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010060,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "えっと、ちょっと……そのぉ……お伝えしておかないと\r\nいけないことがあるといいますかぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？\r\nうん、なんでも言ってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010070,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "あー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010080,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "私、プロフィールだと18歳ってことになってるんですけど\r\n……少し──いやかなり……あの。盛っててぇ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお\r\n……本当はいくつなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010090,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010100,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "……に、25歳でーす……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど\r\nじゃあ同世代だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010110,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "話してくれてありがとう\r\n……言いづらかったよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うちの事務所にも近い年齢のアイドルはいるから\r\n心配しなくて大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "歳は関係ない\r\n必ず『W.I.N.G.』で優勝しよう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010120,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "改めてよろしく、MEMちょさん……で、いいのかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010130,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "あ、私のことはMEMちょで！\r\n同世代ならなおさら、さん付けとか大丈夫です！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010140,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "こちらこそ！\r\nよろしくお願いします、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、おう！\r\nじゃあよろしく、MEMちょ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日から俺は君のファンで、プロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010150,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "！\r\nあ、あはは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あれ\r\n俺、なんかまずいこと言ったかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010160,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "あーっごめんなさい！\r\n全然！　全然なんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010170,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "一応、これまでも活動してきてるのでぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1803001010180,
    "speaker": "MEMちょ",
    "text": "堂々と『今日から』って言われちゃうと\r\nちょっと複雑っていうか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad2",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/180300101/1803001010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや違うんだ！　そういう意味じゃなくて、\r\n俺は絶対に味方だっていうことを伝えたくて──！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mem",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "変にかっこつけるんじゃなかった……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
